Package: pathlyXYZ
Title: An R package for simulating, exploring, and visualizing multidimensional (2.5/3D) bio-logging data 
Version: 0.0.1.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Javier", "Menéndez-Blázquez", , "jmenendezblazquez.gis@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph", "ctb"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-1882-7896"))
Description: A toolkit for processing, simulating, and visualizing 2.5D and 3D 
    spatial data. It provides workflows to integrate movement trajectories 
    (bio-logging) with multi-layered environmental variables across vertical 
    dimensions such as altitude, depth, or pressure. Key features include the 
    generation of vertical sections (e.g.: Hovmöller plots) along complex 
    transects, multidimensional path simulation, and raster stack manipulation 
    for spatial ecology and environmental research.
